[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10501.429, "timestamp": "02:55:01", "text": "他妈的。等待"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10505.15, "timestamp": "02:55:05", "text": "我们刚买了不，不，我们，是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10507.87, "timestamp": "02:55:07", "text": "不，它只是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10510.87, "timestamp": "02:55:10", "text": "嗯，我们之前并没有买下那间租来的房子。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10512.55, "timestamp": "02:55:12", "text": "我们省钱了。所以，没问题。没关系。啊，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10514.63, "timestamp": "02:55:14", "text": "好的。没关系。没关系。我们仍然"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10516.15, "timestamp": "02:55:16", "text": "我们有钱，所以可以直接买。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10519.11, "timestamp": "02:55:19", "text": "下次。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10523.03, "timestamp": "02:55:23", "text": "是的。没关系。好了，开始聊天吧。我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10526.35, "timestamp": "02:55:26", "text": "我要结束这一切了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10529.19, "timestamp": "02:55:29", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10530.95, "timestamp": "02:55:30", "text": "我已经很久没直播了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10536.95, "timestamp": "02:55:36", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10539.67, "timestamp": "02:55:39", "text": "我又有时间了。我们会再次直播。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10541.11, "timestamp": "02:55:41", "text": "乔，你呢？你仍然"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10544.389, "timestamp": "02:55:44", "text": "流媒体。是的。我去睡觉了。实际上，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10546.23, "timestamp": "02:55:46", "text": "我去放水。睡觉。我当时想"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10547.99, "timestamp": "02:55:47", "text": "你本来想说你要……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10550.63, "timestamp": "02:55:50", "text": "继续直播。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10553.91, "timestamp": "02:55:53", "text": "这个人发誓"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10557.59, "timestamp": "02:55:57", "text": "如果这份工作要离开了，那就去参加那个体育比赛吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10559.91, "timestamp": "02:55:59", "text": "居住。"}]